      "title": "3D Letter with Name – Personalized Decoration",
      "slug": "3d-letter-with-name-personalized-decoration",
      "short_description": null,
      "description": "Give the children's room a personal and charming detail 💕 A freestanding letter with the child's name – perfect as a gift for newborns, christening, baby showers or as a decor in the child's room. Each letter is carefully designed in Sweden and made from environmentally friendly bioplastic (PLA) from renewable sources such as corn starch and sugarcane. ✨ Details: • Customizable with any name or letter • Can be decorated with small feet, stars or hearts (send message for requests) • Can be placed on shelf or attached to wall/door with double-sided tape • Made in Sweden 🇸🇪 • Environmentally f"
    },
    {
      "locale": "sv",
